rent College or Kaleidoscope announcements for the date, venue and attendance rules.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kzoo-frelon-performances","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Frelon Dance Company Performances","title":"Catch Both Annual Frelon Shows","subtitle":"Student-led dance spanning ballet, Irish step and hip-hop","notes":"Watch for Frelon’s two yearly performance announcements, then confirm the venue and ticket or entry arrangements for the selected show.","short_summary":"K’s student dance company stages two annual showcases featuring markedly different movement traditions.","evidence_claim":"Kalamazoo College’s student-organization page states that Frelon Dance Company hosts two annual performances featuring styles from ballet and Irish step to hip-hop.","source_url":"https://www.kzoo.edu/student-life/having-fun-at-k/student-organizations/","source_title":"Kalamazoo College Student Organizations — Life at K","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Two performances are held annually; dates, venues and admission arrangements should be verified in current College event notices.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kzoo-chapel-change-ringing","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Stetson Chapel Change Ringing","title":"Hear Eight Bells Speak for Campus","subtitle":"English change ringing from Stetson Chapel’s tower","notes":"Pause on campus when the bells mark a major occasion, and contact the College’s bell community before seeking any tower or ringing access.","short_summary":"Eight inscribed English bells announce moments such as graduation, reflections and DOGL.","evidence_claim":"The College says Stetson Chapel has eight English change-ringing bells that announce important events including community reflections, graduation and DOGL.","source_url":"https://www.kzoo.edu/about/history/","source_title":"College History | About Kalamazoo College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":42.290789,"longitude":-85.601857,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Stetson+Chapel%2C+Kalamazoo+College","access_notes":"The bells can be heard across campus; tower access and hands-on ringing require authorization and should not be assumed.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kzoo-homecoming-reunion-weekend","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Kalamazoo College Homecoming","title":"Return for a Reunion-Style Homecoming","subtitle":"A fall tradition dating to the first homecoming game in 1919","notes":"Build a weekend around the published athletics, concert, tour and reunion schedule; register wherever the current program requires it.","short_summary":"K’s homecoming now mixes Hornet athletics with reunions, campus history and student-alumni events.","evidence_claim":"Kalamazoo College traces its first homecoming game to 1919 and describes today’s homecoming as a reunion weekend involving athletics and alumni-campus programming.","source_url":"https://www.kzoo.edu/about/history/","source_title":"College History | About Kalamazoo College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Homecoming programming varies by year; use the official weekend schedule for registration, venue and audience information.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kzoo-stone-walking-stick-processional","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Stone Walking Stick Processional","title":"Follow a President’s Gold-Tipped Walking Stick","subtitle":"The College mace leads formal academic processions","notes":"Watch the head of a formal academic procession for the chief faculty marshal carrying the gold-tipped stick presented in 1859.","short_summary":"A former president’s walking stick became the ceremonial object leading K’s academic processions.","evidence_claim":"The College states that students gave the gold-tipped stick to first president James A. B. Stone in 1859 and that it is traditionally carried by the chief faculty marshal in academic processions.","source_url":"https://www.kzoo.edu/about/history/stone-walking-stick/","source_title":"Stone Walking Stick | About Kalamazoo College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2017-11-28","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Visible during applicable formal academic processions; participation and seating depend on the rules for the specific ceremony.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kzoo-honor-system-pledge","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Kalamazoo College Honor System Pledge","title":"Enter K by Joining Its Honor System","subtitle":"A written commitment expected from incoming students","notes":"Read the Honor System before completing the written commitment, and ask the Dean of Students when a rule or responsibility is unclear.","short_summary":"Joining the College includes formally accepting shared responsibility for its academic community.","evidence_claim":"Kalamazoo College says all entering students are expected to understand and follow its Honor System and indicate their willingness to do so in writing.","source_url":"https://parents.kzoo.edu/campus-resources/about-the-honor-system/","source_title":"About the Honor System – For Parents and Families | Kalamazoo College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2022-02-01","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"This is an entering-student commitment rather than a public event; follow the College’s official onboarding process.","cost_status":"not_applicable